WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,280
Husband, why are you running?

2
00:00:01,280 --> 00:00:02,680
Didn't you see him like that just now?

3
00:00:02,680 --> 00:00:04,080
You did something wrong and you dared to hurt us

4
00:00:04,080 --> 00:00:05,880
Are you afraid of your wife? Are you wrong?

5
00:00:05,880 --> 00:00:06,880
I'm not afraid

6
00:00:06,880 --> 00:00:08,360
But for our safety consideration

7
00:00:08,360 --> 00:00:09,720
We are the social elite

8
00:00:09,720 --> 00:00:11,080
happy family

9
00:00:11,080 --> 00:00:12,760
People at the bottom of society like Lin Dong

10
00:00:12,760 --> 00:00:14,000
He will definitely be jealous

11
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:15,240
If you make him anxious

12
00:00:15,240 --> 00:00:16,960
What should we do if he goes crazy and takes revenge?

13
00:00:16,960 --> 00:00:18,760
No more husband

14
00:00:18,760 --> 00:00:20,520
Let's call the police and arrest him.

15
00:00:20,520 --> 00:00:21,960
Lin Dong has a cowardly character

16
00:00:21,960 --> 00:00:23,200
Didn't completely drive him to the edge

17
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:24,400
He doesn't dare to do anything

18
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:25,800
That's enough.

19
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:27,400
You should always remember a happy person

20
00:00:27,400 --> 00:00:28,440
concession principle

21
00:00:28,440 --> 00:00:29,680
We are the happy ones

22
00:00:29,760 --> 00:00:32,560
It's really better to take a step back if you can get a refund.

23
00:00:32,560 --> 00:00:34,750
Of course it's true

24
00:00:34,750 --> 00:00:39,330
I hope Lin Dong is not some hooligan.

25
00:00:39,330 --> 00:00:40,850
Otherwise I can't beat him
